"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211012010:0":{"text":"こんな面白い場所は生まれて初めてだ。喋る生き物に、謎の財宝……まさに大冒険って感じだな！","source_cn":"这多有意思，没见过的地方，会说话的当地生物，神秘的宝藏...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F70EEF6DA7BCD8F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"こんな面白い場所は生まれて初めてだ。喋る生き物に、謎の財宝……まさに大冒険って感じだな！","female":"こんな面白い場所は生まれて初めてだ。喋る生き物に、謎の財宝……まさに大冒険って感じだな！","variant_male_record_index":"129289","variant_female_record_index":"129290","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211012011:1":{"text":"ソニアさんはどう思いますか？","source_cn":"索尼娅觉得呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAC1295C5CDEB681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211012012:0":{"text":"……あり得ないことばかりで、もはや考えるだけ無駄な気がしてきたよ。","source_cn":"……太不合常理，我拒绝思考。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96E129FCE974CFED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211012013:1":{"text":"魚！海の命！","source_cn":"鱼！海中的生灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC276A9417AFFE8AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211012014:0":{"text":"思い出したぞ！<style=\"stress\">海の命が海に帰るとき、海の娘が目を覚ます</style>……これも歌詞の一部だ。","source_cn":"啊，我想起来了！<style=stress>当海中的生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31299D17B476BA0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211012015:1":{"text":"グブリン、俺たちに海の生き物、つまり魚を海に返してほしいんだな？","source_cn":"咕布林，你想要让我们把海中的生灵，也就是鱼归海吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B4EA4AE54861B4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211012016:0":{"text":"返す、違う！三種の魚……皿に載せて、姫にあげる！","source_cn":"不是归海！三种鱼……放盘子里！给公主！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B5472A3B0CE2D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1211012017:0":{"text":"つまり、次の試練は三種類の魚を見つけ出し、なんかの皿に載せて、海の姫様とやらに捧げるんだな？","source_cn":"意思是，下一道试炼是要找到三种鱼，放在某个盘子里？献给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B0F1CF36D25777","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1211012018:1":{"text":"グフフフー！","source_cn":"哦呼呼~~~！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8239A3B4206474C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1211012019:1":{"text":"グブリンから試練の手がかりをもらうなんて……私は夢でも見ているのかしら？","source_cn":"咕布林居然会提醒我们钓鱼试炼的线索，简直像在做梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57B654F337274BCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}